    {
      "heading": "A new nearest challenger",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board",
        "person-yi-chia-chen-identity-0"
      ],
      "text": "Yi-Chia Chen is second on the evening ARC-AGI-2 public board at 82.64. The afternoon observation recorded a rise from 77.22 in third to 82.64 in second, moving her above rabbithole’s 80.56. Tufa Labs stays first at 88.06, leaving a 5.42-point gap. Chen’s prior-evening comparison is unavailable, so the recorded afternoon event is the measure of this move."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Tufa’s lead belongs to the team",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board",
        "person-dries-smit-identity-0",
        "person-jeroen-cottaar-identity-0",
        "person-isaiahp-fact-1",
        "person-stefano-viel-identity-0"
      ],
      "text": "Tufa’s leading score is unchanged against the previous evening boundary. Its ARC-2 roster lists Dries Smit, Jeroen Cottaar, Isaiah Pressman and Stefano Viel under their verified Kaggle handles. That is this competition’s four-account roster; it should not be confused with Tufa’s different ARC-3 entry. Behind the leading three, nvbanana remains fourth at 77.08, with cpmpml and darraghdog listed."
    },
    {
      "heading": "The chase below the podium",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board",
        "wire-2026-10-13-0605-arc-2-domdolus-tolus-storms-into-gold"
      ],
      "text": "Domdolus Tolus is eighth at 65.14, up 13.47 points and three places against this edition’s comparison. The morning wire described a much larger rise from an earlier rolling window; tonight’s gain must be measured from the prior evening boundary. Dawid Kopiczko is seventh at 66.25 after a 3.19-point gain, ARC Raiders ninth at 64.58, and Majkel1337 tenth at 62.08 after adding 9.58."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Arcnights reaches the line, fshindo advances",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board",
        "wire-2026-10-13-1557-arc-2-arcnights-enters-gold"
      ],
      "text": "Arcnights adds 16.81 points to 48.75, climbing from 216th at this edition’s baseline to 16th. The afternoon wire had observed the team at 15th; its unchanged score now illustrates how quickly a place can slip. Tonight’s gold-score threshold is also 48.75, compared with 47.92 yesterday evening. The score threshold alone does not settle a tied team’s medal position. fshindo climbs from 31st to 18th with an 8.33-point gain to 45.83, while shiiin9 rises from 273rd to 19th at the same displayed score. Public medal bands remain provisional."
    },
    {
      "heading": "A competitor’s satisfaction",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board",
        "social-2109688065099006141",
        "person-fshindo-identity-0",
        "person-fshindo-identity-1"
      ],
      "text": "In a public Japanese post on October 12, fshindo said reaching ARC-2’s medal range was especially pleasing after putting time and effort into the contest without results. Tonight’s fresh rise adds a new chapter to that dated reaction. The verified Kaggle account ffsscf links directly to @crysis44k; this ARC-2 entry remains distinct from the person’s ARC-3 team."
    }
